WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.337
Here's where each service stands in G C
C, from the guide's availability table.

2
00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:10.597
Microsoft Graph: G C C uses the
worldwide graph dot microsoft dot com,

3
00:00:10.597 --> 00:00:12.851
with the Global environment.

4
00:00:12.851 --> 00:00:17.300
Exchange Online: the default
environment, so no parameter is needed.

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.563
Security and Compliance:
the default endpoint.

6
00:00:20.563 --> 00:00:22.312
Azure: Azure Cloud.

7
00:00:22.312 --> 00:00:26.933
And the SharePoint admin address ends
in dash admin dot sharepoint dot com.

8
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:31.255
Until a run has been proved in your own
cloud, run one pillar at a time in a

9
00:00:31.255 --> 00:00:36.100
test tenant of the same cloud, and keep
ScubaGear as the federal baseline tool.
